' --- cross-context integration ---
PendingPublicSubmission ..> Proposal : materialises on confirm (SubmitProposal)
PendingPublicSubmission ..> RequesterContact : captured as requesterContact
RequesterContact ..> Permission : provisioned as EXTERNAL requester on approval
PublicDocumentSubmission ..> Document : materialises as (submittedBy null)

note as N_PublicSubmission
  Unauthenticated citizen intake (double opt-in). Step 1 stores a pending,
  unverified submission and e-mails a single-use token; step 2 confirms it,
  materialising a Proposal through SubmitProposal (Use of Collections) with
  requesterContact instead of a system Permission. Identity user/permission
  provisioning and CollectionUseProject creation are deferred to approval.
  Uploads are allowlisted, capped, and materialised as proposal documents
  on confirm with submittedBy null.
end note
N_PublicSubmission .. PendingPublicSubmission

