note as N_MuseumQuestions
  "Pergunte ao Museu" — a lightweight public question channel, deliberately
  separate from Proposal/Conversation (User Request context): one question,
  one reply e-mail, no thread, no account. The public intake plan
  (museum-questions-public-page-plan.md, IMPLEMENTED) only ever produces
  SUBMITTED rows; the answer/out-of-scope/close behaviour and their audit
  fields are handled by the internal response section
  (museum-questions-response-section-plan.md, IMPLEMENTED), which reuses the
  existing schema and needs no migration of its own. CLOSED is reachable
  only from ANSWERED or OUT_OF_SCOPE, never directly from SUBMITTED — every
  question gets a real answer or an out-of-scope reply before it can be
  archived. Catalog administration mirrors Collection Object Index's
  SYS_ADMIN-only pattern where relevant (curator-style scoping does not
  apply here — any staff member may answer, per require_staff).
end note
N_MuseumQuestions .. MuseumQuestion

